			"Message": "style(Sky): Capitalize Editor.Land domain in README links\n\nThe README contained lowercase editor.land URLs that should use the proper Editor.Land capitalization per the project's domain conventions. Update three documentation links to use the correct casing.\n\nThis ensures consistent domain presentation across project documentation.",
